{"id":1096,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>&nbsp; 12月14日，由山西省汽车工程学会主办的“山西省汽车工程学会2025学术年会暨首届智能车竞赛”在晋中市隆重召开。本次竞赛以“车联三晋、智创未来”为主题，聚焦智能网联汽车技术发展，吸引了来自全省多所高校与企业的团队参与。中北大学智能车辆与先进动力团队在团队负责人马富康教授的带领下，选派两支队伍（研究生和本科生）参加智慧交通沙盘组的比赛，由罗佳、郑利锋两位老师全程指导备赛与参赛。</p><p> 比赛中，两支队伍基于专业领域的扎实积累，围绕智慧交通场景开展算法设计、系统调试与实时优化，展现出良好的工程素养与团队协作能力。经过激烈角逐，由罗佳老师指导的研究生队伍荣获二等奖，郑利锋老师指导的本科生队伍获得三等奖，展现了中北大学在车辆工程及智能交通领域的教学实力与人才培养成效。</p><p>本次活动进一步提升了中北大学在区域汽车工程领域的学科影响力，也为后续推进智能交通技术产学研协同创新奠定了良好基础。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xUllJ8ozL4MNlYU0zLDL7M7U4VkMz9aYn7CiM4LaUNQkMzL0gihFp2hmCIa0okysM1yPoSy8nN7YMRMRozQknmlZMN74Mz6fU8-iL8-Do7nFLl-8MNUsMRAFLlWfMRNJv2bjo4OeoD6N62L0qIbtpYyPLR7ig47PMz-ZgtA8pUPcc&oid=1101042922&tid=1015&nid=11528&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/876194FA243C96BF586A357ACB53B68D/1B46D748/1BA49\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xM4AJ7L7V7U4nRM04WfLNlbMRvbUlCa4L4UbLlVkL4v8UN-0gihFp2hmCIa0USyYnShkMkysnzUPMm9ZozVVLllDn7UDnmMRLRAfMRAVMmfFnlCYn7LYolWFUNUaLz-Jv2bjo4OeoD6N62L0qIbtpYyPLR7ig47PMz-ZgtA8pUPcc&oid=1101042922&tid=1015&nid=11528&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xozLJYnzG8ozvDo0zW2ozvPMlWfUmQaVnzTkL4A2L7l8LlU0gihFp2hmCIa0LSh2n1ysUYh2ozl8UzvsLN7DUz7PnNQRM46RU8UZLlVVL7nFMR9PUzGDU8nFLlVVM7LJv2bjo4OeoD6N62L0qIbtpYyPLR7ig47PMz-ZgtA8pUPcc&oid=1101042922&tid=1015&nid=11528&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1FF7CF954A772A6A11FFC77CCD81AE0D/481A06CD/1AE4C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xMR6J7ollDUmTVL04liMNlanm7bU46a2o7rknRv4nNU8Mm70gihFp2hmCIa0U1yaMSyYMYhRLR67n7C4nl7aLm9DMNUboRV2olCinm-4UlrFLmG8MlnkMRrFUN-anzNJv2bjo4OeoD6N62L0qIbtpYyPLR7ig47PMz-ZgtA8pUPcc&oid=1101042922&tid=1015&nid=11528&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xo7UJaMzvZLzUDU04C4MzlaMNWkU8ra2M7lZU8WfMRnfozU0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh2LShkokyanRQ2Lm-8L8MRLmM2oR-Pol-aLN-4M7-DMRTFLN7YM8-sMzMFLz7soRlJv2bjo4OeoD6N62L0qIbtpYyPLR7ig47PMz-ZgtA8pUPcc&oid=1101042922&tid=1015&nid=11528&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_